WEBVTT

00:17:28.774 --> 00:17:30.694
We want the faculty to be entrepreneurs,

00:17:30.694 --> 00:17:35.403
we want everybody 
to be really able to take a chance to try.

00:17:35.403 --> 00:17:38.853
We keep insisting to all our faculty, 
to all our students

00:17:38.853 --> 00:17:41.520
that ideas are worth nothing

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:46.960
unless they are really taking action
or being put into action.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:52.910
So, the university has built its system
in supporting students and the faculty

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:55.661
and the researcher to give it a try,

00:17:55.897 --> 00:17:59.536
to take a risk, to fail, and to try again.

00:17:59.733 --> 00:18:04.084
So, we built the institution 
and provided the training,